      a: "We do. Hosting, SSL, security, backups, and small updates are included in the monthly fee. There is no CMS to learn and nothing to update yourself.",
    },
    {
      q: "Do you build sites in French?",
      a: "Yes. We work in English and French, and build French-first commercial content for Quebec-facing businesses.",
    },
    {
      q: "How long does it take?",
      a: "Most sites launch in 2 to 3 weeks from complete materials. You get a private preview within a few days and one revision round.",
    },
    {
      q: "Can I add Local SEO or a blog later?",
      a: "Yes. Local SEO costs C$159.99 per month, a weekly SEO blog C$29.99 per month, and a DIY Blog Page C$19.99 per month. You can add them when you are ready.",
    },
    {
      q: "What is the best custom website in Canada for a small business?",
